# Pressing W on a Today entry makes it due tomorrow: it leaves Today and focus moves to the next entry.
file <<END
- Post office @due({today})
- Bank @due({today})
- Pharmacy @due({today})
END
keys gt
see Today
keys j W
hide Bank
see ▌ - Pharmacy
quit
saved <<END
- Post office @due({today})
- Bank @due({today+1})
- Pharmacy @due({today})
END
